  sentences:
    nameNPC: "Tr\u1EA7n L\xE3m"
    Lines:
    - "(Gi\u1ECDng kh\xE2m ph\u1EE5c) Thua m\xE0 v\u1EABn hi\xEAn ngang. Qu\xE2n
      \u0111\xE3 tan, c\u1EA7u \u0111\xE3 g\xE3y, \u0111\u1ECBch bao v\xE2y t\u1EE9
      ph\xEDa, m\xE0 h\u1EAFn v\u1EABn d\xE1m x\xF4ng l\xEAn \u0111\xE1nh ta. Kh\xED
      ph\xE1ch nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF... ta kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 khinh th\u01B0\u1EDDng."
    - "Tr\u1EADn n\xE0y, \u0110inh Ho\xE0n thua v\u1EC1 binh l\u1EF1c, nh\u01B0ng
      kh\xF4ng thua v\u1EC1 kh\xED th\u1EBF. Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi nh\u01B0 th\u1EBF m\xE0
      gi\u1EBFt \u0111i... th\u1EADt ph\xED."
